[
  {
    "id": "58814510-c025-4db4-80cf-c33df2f307d5",
    "title": "A Bad Feeling",
    "slug": "a-bad-feeling",
    "content": "<h2>Step 1: Accept the Quest</h2><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_0_00-01.jpg\" alt=\"Accepting the Quest\"></p><ul><li>Accept the quest titled \"A Bad Feeling\" from Celeste in the main hub.</li><li>The objective is to find and search any ARC Probe or ARC Courier.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Locate an ARC Probe/Courier</h2><p>ARC Probes and Couriers are not marked on your map initially; they will only appear once you are in close proximity.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_1_00-08.jpg\" alt=\"Finding a Crashed Probe\"></p><ul><li>A known location for an ARC Probe is near the Hydroponic Dome Complex on the Dam Battlegrounds map.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_2_00-19.jpg\" alt=\"Map Location for ARC Probe\"></p><ul><li>Once you get close enough, the probe will appear on your map as a radar icon.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_3_00-26.jpg\" alt=\"Probe Appears on Map\"></p><h2>Step 3: Breach and Search the Probe</h2><ul><li>Approach the ARC Probe or Courier and interact with it to begin the \"Breach\" process.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_4_00-29.jpg\" alt=\"Initiating Breach\"></p><ul><li>Breaching takes a short amount of time, during which you are vulnerable. Be sure to watch your back.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_5_00-34.jpg\" alt=\"Breaching in Progress\"></p><ul><li>Once breached, interact with it again to \"Search\" the probe.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_6_00-41.jpg\" alt=\"Searching the Probe\"></p><ul><li>You will typically receive valuable items such as ARC Alloy and ARC Performance Steel upon searching.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_7_00-45.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Item Collected\"></p><h2>Step 4: Complete the Quest</h2><ul><li>After successfully searching the probe, the quest will be marked as complete.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_8_00-50.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Completion Notification\"></p><ul><li>Return to Celeste at the main hub to claim your quest rewards.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_9_01-09.jpg\" alt=\"Claiming Quest Rewards\"></p><ul><li>Rewards for this quest include Metal Parts, Steel Spring, and Duct Tape.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_10_01-12.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Rewards Displayed\"></p>",
    "summary": "This guide details how to locate and search ARC Probes or Couriers to complete the \"A Bad Feeling\" quest in Arc Raiders, including a specific location example on the Dam Battlegrounds map.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-bad-feeling_0_00-01.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Find and search any ARC Probe or ARC Courier"
    ],
