  {
    "id": "c600f65f-a8f6-4e60-b66c-457b3281b9be",
    "title": "A Balanced Harvest",
    "slug": "a-balanced-harvest",
    "content": "<p>This guide will walk you through the \"A Balanced Harvest\" quest, detailing how to find Lucille Ludi's notes to complete the objective. The quest requires you to navigate the Research &amp; Administration building and locate specific research project notes.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Research &amp; Administration Building</h2><p>Begin by opening your map and pinpointing the Research &amp; Administration building. It's identifiable by its distinct architecture and is situated near the Control Tower, as shown here.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-balanced-harvest_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Research &amp; Administration Location\"></p><ul><li>The building is located in the Dam Battlegrounds area.</li><li>Look for the structure labeled \"Research &amp; Administration\" on your map, positioned close to the \"Control Tower\" landmark.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Enter the Building</h2><p>Approach the building and find an accessible entry point. The most direct route is often through damaged sections or openings at ground level.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-balanced-harvest_1_00-07.jpg\" alt=\"Building Entry Point\"></p><ul><li>Enter the building through the open section or damaged wall on the ground floor.</li><li>This entrance will lead you into a lower-level area, likely a reception or maintenance section.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Ascend to the Upper Floor</h2><p>Once inside, your goal is to reach the upper floor above the reception area. Utilize the environment to climb upwards.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-balanced-harvest_2_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Climbing Elevator Shaft\"></p><ul><li>Locate the open elevator shaft within the building.</li><li>Interact with the shaft to climb up to the next floor.</li><li>Upon reaching the upper level, you'll be in what appears to be a reception or office area.</li><li>Take a right from the elevator shaft and proceed down the hallway.</li><li>You'll see Lab 1 written on the wall</li></ul><h2>Step 4: Find Lucille Ludi's Notes</h2><p>Navigate through the upper floor, following the path through the laboratory sections until you find a desk with a computer where the notes are located.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-balanced-harvest_3_00-22.jpg\" alt=\"Lucille Ludi Notes Found\"></p><ul><li>Continue through the corridors, turning right as needed to progress through the lab.</li><li>The notes are found on a desk next to an old computer setup, illuminated by natural light from the large windows.</li></ul><h2>Step 5: Collect the Notes</h2><p>Once you've spotted Lucille Ludi's notes on the desk, approach them and interact to collect them, completing the quest objective.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-balanced-harvest_4_00-25.jpg\" alt=\"Collecting Notes\"></p><ul><li>Interact with the notes to pick them up.</li><li>Collecting the notes will trigger the quest completion for \"A Balanced Harvest.\"</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "A step-by-step guide to completing the \"A Balanced Harvest\" quest in Arc Raiders, focusing on locating and collecting Lucille Ludi's notes within the Research & Administration building.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-balanced-harvest_2_00-15.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In one round:",
      "Go to the Research & Administration building",
      "Locate Lab 1 on the upper floor above the reception",
      "Search for any traces of the agricultural research project"
    ],
