  {
    "id": "afbdbf52-8502-4987-8ed7-9645dd2cff38",
    "title": "A Better Use",
    "slug": "a-better-use",
    "content": "<p>To complete 'A Better Use' quest, you'll need to interact with Supply Call Stations found around the map and then loot the supply drops they provide.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate a Supply Call Station</h2><ul><li>First, open your map to view your active quests. The 'A Better Use' quest will guide you to areas containing Supply Call Stations.</li><li>Identify the 'Supply Call Station' icon on your map. These are typically marked in designated zones for the quest. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-better-use_0_00-10.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Location on Map\"></li><li>The video highlights that you can find these stations in various locations, such as the Village, Supply Call Station, or Reinforced Reception areas. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-better-use_1_00-12.jpg\" alt=\"Identifying Supply Call Stations\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Request a Supply Drop</h2><ul><li>Travel to one of the identified Supply Call Station locations on the map.</li><li>Once you arrive, look for a tall antenna-like structure. This is the Supply Call Station. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-better-use_2_00-16.jpg\" alt=\"Approaching the Station\"></li><li>Approach the station and hold the interact button (E on PC) to 'REQUEST SUPPLY DROP'. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-better-use_3_00-19.jpg\" alt=\"Requesting Supply Drop\"></li><li>The station will then initiate a request for a supply drop.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Loot the Drop</h2><ul><li>After requesting the supply drop, look up at the sky. A drone will fly in and drop a supply crate. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-better-use_4_00-24.jpg\" alt=\"Supply Drop Incoming\"></li><li>Note that the supply drop might not land at the exact spot where you requested it; watch to see where it lands.</li><li>Once the supply crate lands, proceed to its location and interact with it to loot its contents.</li><li>Looting the supply drop will complete the 'A Better Use' quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide details the steps to complete the 'A Better Use' quest in Arc Raiders, which involves locating Supply Call Stations, requesting supply drops, and then looting the dropped items.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-better-use_0_00-10.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Request in a Supply Drop from a Call Station",
      "Loot a Supply Drop"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
