  {
    "id": "03c78860-d257-4be0-ac79-c4fe59a4a3c8",
    "title": "A First Foothold",
    "slug": "a-first-foothold",
    "content": "<p>This guide will walk you through the 'A First Foothold' quest in Arc Raiders, showing you the exact locations and steps needed to interact with four different objectives on The Blue Gate map.</p><h2>Step 1: Rotate the Satellite Dish</h2><p>The first objective requires you to rotate a satellite dish located on the church roof, north of the Data Vault.</p><ul><li>Open your map to locate the church, which is north of the Data Vault. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_0_00-03.jpg\" alt=\"First Objective Location on Map\"></li><li>Approach the church structure.</li><li>Climb the scaffolding on the side of the church to reach the roof. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_1_00-14.jpg\" alt=\"Climbing to the Church Roof\"></li><li>Once on the roof, locate the satellite dish.</li><li>Interact with the satellite dish to rotate it and complete this objective. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_2_00-19.jpg\" alt=\"Rotating the Satellite Dish\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Nail Down the Roof Plates</h2><p>For the second objective, you'll need to nail down roof plates on a Raider structure near Trapper's Glade.</p><ul><li>Head to the indicated location on your map, near Trapper's Glade. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_3_00-26.jpg\" alt=\"Second Objective Location on Map\"></li><li>Locate the Raider structure with the loose roof plates.</li><li>Approach the roof plates and interact with them to secure them. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_4_00-34.jpg\" alt=\"Nailing Down Roof Plates\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Enable the Comms Terminal</h2><p>The third part of the quest involves enabling a comms terminal located near the Olive Grove.</p><ul><li>Check your map for the exact location near the Olive Grove. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_5_00-42.jpg\" alt=\"Third Objective Location on Map\"> This objective is slightly hidden.</li><li>Find the comms terminal on top of a broken truck or structure.</li><li>Interact with the comms terminal to enable it. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_6_00-48.jpg\" alt=\"Enabling the Comms Terminal\"></li></ul><h2>Step 4: Stabilize the Observation Deck</h2><p>The final objective is to stabilize the observation deck near Ridgeline.</p><ul><li>Navigate to the Ridgeline area, as shown on your map. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_7_01-02.jpg\" alt=\"Fourth Objective Location on Map\"></li><li>Locate the observation deck structure.</li><li>Interact with the yellow marker to stabilize the deck and complete the 'A First Foothold' quest. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_8_01-07.jpg\" alt=\"Stabilizing the Observation Deck\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "A detailed guide to completing the 'A First Foothold' quest in Arc Raiders. This guide outlines the four distinct locations on The Blue Gate map where you need to interact with various structures to progress and complete the quest objectives.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-first-foothold_0_00-03.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Stabilize the observation deck near the Ridgeline",
      "Enable the comms terminal near the Olive Grove",
      "Rotate the satellite dishes on the church roof, north of Data Vault",
      "Nail down the roof plates on the Raider structure near Trapper's Glade"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
