  {
    "id": "01291ace-5c46-4e10-9577-bc2ba4d5cffc",
    "title": "A New Type of Plant",
    "slug": "a-new-type-of-plant",
    "content": "<p>To complete the \"A New Type of Plant\" quest, you'll need to find and gather a specific \"Possibly Toxic Plant\" located in the Dam Battlegrounds area. This guide will walk you through its exact location and how to easily turn in the quest item.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Quest Zone</h2><p>The quest takes place in the Dam Battlegrounds. Open your map to pinpoint the general area marked as \"Old Battleground\" near the center of the map. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-new-type-of-plant_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Look for the \"Old Battleground\" marker on your map within the Dam Battlegrounds region.</li><li>This area is characterized by large, crashed structures and dense foliage.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Identify Plant Spawn Points</h2><p>Once in the Old Battleground, head towards the large, crashed structure that resembles a broken barn or facility. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-new-type-of-plant_1_00-10.jpg\" alt=\"Specific Plant Location\"></p><ul><li>The toxic plants typically spawn around the base of this massive, broken structure.</li><li>There are usually multiple spawn points very close to each other.</li><li>Keep an eye out for bright orange, somewhat spiky plants amidst the tall grass and debris.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Gather the Plant</h2><p>Approach one of the identified toxic plants and interact with it to gather it. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-new-type-of-plant_2_00-18.jpg\" alt=\"Gathering the Plant\"></p><ul><li>Press the interaction button (usually 'E') when prompted to \"Gather\" the plant.</li><li>You only need one plant to complete the quest.</li></ul><h2>Step 4: Secure and Turn In</h2><p>After gathering the plant, open your inventory and place the \"Possibly Toxic Plant\" into your Safe Pocket. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-new-type-of-plant_3_00-23.jpg\" alt=\"Inventory &amp; Safe Pocket\"></p><ul><li>Transfer the plant to your Safe Pocket to ensure it's not lost upon death.</li><li>To quickly complete the quest simply exfil and turn in</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide details how to efficiently complete the \"A New Type of Plant\" quest in Arc Raiders by locating and gathering the \"Possibly Toxic Plant\" near the Old Battleground and turning it in.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-new-type-of-plant_0_00-05.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In One Round:",
      "Search for the new plant near the Baron Husk in the Old Battleground",
      "Deliver the Possibly Toxic Plant to Lance"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
      {
