  {
    "id": "d0693ddd-1a31-4398-ba6f-ddca29f72ee4",
    "title": "A Reveal in Ruins",
    "slug": "a-reveal-in-ruins",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'A Reveal in Ruins' quest requires you to locate an ESR Analyzer inside a pharmacy in Buried City and deliver it to Lance. Pharmacies are not explicitly marked on your map, but they are typically found near metro stations. This guide will show you the exact locations of two pharmacies in Buried City where you can find the analyzer.</p><h2>Step 1: Accept the Quest from Lance</h2><p>You will need to accept the 'A Reveal in Ruins' quest from Lance. He will task you with finding an ESR Analyzer inside a pharmacy in Buried City.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_0_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Details &amp; Rewards\"></p><ul><li>The quest objective is to search for an ESR Analyzer inside any pharmacy in Buried City.</li><li>Lance offers rewards including a Tactical MIL 3 (Healing) augment and a Surge Shield Recharger.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Locate a Pharmacy in Buried City</h2><p>There are two primary pharmacy locations in Buried City that are close to metro stations. These buildings are recognizable by a green cross symbol on their exterior.</p><h3>First Pharmacy Location</h3><p>The first pharmacy is located near a metro station.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_1_00-30.jpg\" alt=\"First Pharmacy Exterior\"></p><ul><li>Look for a building with a green cross symbol, typically near a metro entrance.</li><li>On the map, this pharmacy is located north of Piazza Arlotto, near the Metro Entrance waypoint. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_2_00-37.jpg\" alt=\"First Pharmacy Map Location\"></li><li>You will need to breach the door to enter. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_3_00-53.jpg\" alt=\"Breaching First Pharmacy Door\"></li></ul><h3>Second Pharmacy Location</h3><p>The second pharmacy can be found in a different part of Buried City.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_4_00-57.jpg\" alt=\"Second Pharmacy Exterior\"></p><ul><li>This pharmacy also has a 'Farmacia' sign and a green cross symbol on its exterior.</li><li>On the map, this pharmacy is located in the southern part of Buried City, near Piazza Roma and the Main Street area. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_5_01-05.jpg\" alt=\"Second Pharmacy Map Location\"></li><li>Breach the door to gain entry to this building as well. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_6_01-17.jpg\" alt=\"Breaching Second Pharmacy Door\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Find and Secure the ESR Analyzer</h2><p>Once inside a pharmacy, you'll need to locate the ESR Analyzer. It's often found on a counter or shelf.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_7_01-31.jpg\" alt=\"Locating ESR Analyzer\"></p><ul><li>Inside the pharmacy, look for a counter. The ESR Analyzer is a small, yellow device.</li><li>Interact with the device to pick it up. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_8_01-34.jpg\" alt=\"Interacting with ESR Analyzer\"></li><li><strong>CRITICAL:</strong> Immediately place the ESR Analyzer into your 'Safe Pocket'. This ensures you don't lose the item if you get knocked out or eliminated before returning to base. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_9_01-40.jpg\" alt=\"Placing in Safe Pocket\"></li></ul><h2>Step 4: Deliver the ESR Analyzer to Lance</h2><p>After successfully securing the ESR Analyzer in your Safe Pocket, you can return to base and deliver it to Lance to complete the quest.</p><ul><li>Even if you are knocked out during your run, the ESR Analyzer in your safe pocket will be retained. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_10_02-07.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Item Secured (Knocked Out)\"></li><li>Return to Lance at your base.</li><li>Talk to Lance and select the option to deliver the ESR Analyzer to complete the quest and claim your rewards. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_11_02-27.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Completion\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/esr-analyzer_0_00-15.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In one round: Search for an ESR Analyzer inside any pharmacy in Buried City",
      "Delivery the ESR Analyzer to Lance"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
