  {
    "id": "03dd7934-2f52-4a3a-ab2b-54a0be2a2f58",
    "title": "A Symbol of Unification",
    "slug": "a-symbol-of-unification",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>To complete the 'A Symbol of Unification' quest, you'll need to navigate to the Furnace Outpost on the Dam map, find the Raider Flag inside, and then hoist it on the designated flagpole overlooking the lake.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Formicai Outpost</h2><p>Your first objective is to reach the Furnace Outpost, situated at the top of a hill on the Dam map.</p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-symbol-of-unification_0_00-04.jpg\" alt=\"Outpost Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Follow the path shown in the video, climbing up the terrain until you reach the outpost building. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-symbol-of-unification_1_00-24.jpg\" alt=\"Arrive at Outpost\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Retrieve the Raider Flag</h2><p>Once you arrive at the outpost, you'll need to enter the building and locate the Raider Flag.</p><ul><li>Enter the outpost building.</li><li>Inside, look for a desk with a bag on top. Interact with the bag to search it and retrieve the Raider Flag. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-symbol-of-unification_2_00-29.jpg\" alt=\"Retrieve Raider Flag\"></li><li>The Raider Flag will appear in your inventory once collected. </li></ul><h2>Step 3: Hoist the Flag</h2><p>With the Raider Flag in hand, proceed to the flagpole at the end of the outpost to complete the quest.</p><ul><li>Proceed through the outpost building to the small platform overlooking the lake. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-symbol-of-unification_3_00-44.jpg\" alt=\"Flagpole View\"></li><li>Locate the flagpole and interact with it to hoist the Raider Flag. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-symbol-of-unification_4_00-47.jpg\" alt=\"Hoist the Flag\"></li><li>Successfully hoisting the flag will complete the 'A Symbol of Unification' quest. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-symbol-of-unification_5_00-50.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Complete\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide details the steps to complete the 'A Symbol of Unification' quest in Arc Raiders, involving locating the Formicai Outpost, retrieving the Raider Flag, and hoisting it on the flagpole.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-symbol-of-unification_5_00-50.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In One Round:",
      "Reach the Formicai Outpost in Dam Battlegrounds",
      "Locate the flag at the Formicai Outpost",
      "Hoist the flag on the small platform overlooking the Red Lake"
    ],
