  {
    "id": "45a5c563-3d91-44f8-86a8-8f462e3a2ba3",
    "title": "A Warm Place to Rest",
    "slug": "a-warm-place-to-rest",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'A Warm Place to Rest' quest in Arc Raiders requires you to follow a series of clues leading to a specific location where you'll find a grave to inspect. This guide will walk you through each step, from finding the initial camp to completing the quest.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Abandoned Highway Camp</h2><ul><li>Open your map and locate the 'Buried City' area.</li><li>Find the quest marker for 'A Warm Place to Rest' in the southwest region, specifically at the 'Abandoned Highway Camp'.</li><li>Travel to this location. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-warm-place-to-rest_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Locate Starting Point\"></li><li>Once you arrive, you will be on a ruined highway segment between two damaged buses.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Follow the Red Markers</h2><ul><li>Near the front of one of the buses, you'll find a backpack on the ground. Interact with it to 'Search for any signs of survivors'. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-warm-place-to-rest_1_00-14.jpg\" alt=\"Inspect Backpack\"></li><li>This will trigger the next objective: 'Follow the red markers'.</li><li>Open your map again; new red markers will now be visible, leading you towards the 'Town Hall' area. Set a waypoint to guide you. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-warm-place-to-rest_2_00-22.jpg\" alt=\"Waypoint to Markers\"></li><li>Begin following these red markers along the damaged highway.</li><li>Continue along the path, passing various wreckage and environmental hazards.</li><li>The markers will lead you off the highway and down a sandy slope towards some buildings. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-warm-place-to-rest_5_01-49.jpg\" alt=\"Approaching the Grave\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Inspect the Grave</h2><ul><li>As you approach the final marker, a notification to 'Inspect the grave' will appear.</li><li>Locate the grave site among the rocks and debris. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-warm-place-to-rest_6_01-55.jpg\" alt=\"Inspect the Grave\"></li><li>Interact with the grave to complete the quest 'A Warm Place to Rest'. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-warm-place-to-rest_7_02-00.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Complete\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides a detailed walkthrough for completing the 'A Warm Place to Rest' quest in Arc Raiders. Learn how to locate the starting point, follow the red markers, and find the grave to complete the quest.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/a-warm-place-to-rest_6_01-55.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
