  {
    "id": "f796b242-6629-48b6-9a8a-3a80b8e58f03",
    "title": "After Rain Comes",
    "slug": "after-rain-comes",
    "content": "<p>This guide will walk you through the steps to successfully complete the 'After Rain Comes' quest in Arc Raiders. The quest involves finding and repairing solar panels located near the Grandioso Apartments, requiring specific materials. Y<span style=\"color: rgb(230, 255, 255);\">ou will need </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 255, 255);\">5 Wires</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 255, 255);\"> and </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 255, 255);\">2 Batteries</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 255, 255);\"> to repair the solar panels. You should bring them in with your loadout.</span></p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Quest Objective</h2><p>Your first task is to navigate to the correct location on the map.</p><ul><li>Open your map to find the 'After Rain Comes' quest under Buried City.</li><li>The objective is located at the Grandioso Apartments in West Village. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/after-rain-comes_0_00-06.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Location Map\"></li><li>Set a waypoint to guide you to the exact spot.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Gather Required Materials</h2><p>Before attempting the repair, ensure you have the necessary components in your inventory.</p><ul><li>You will need <strong>5 Wires</strong> and <strong>2 Batteries</strong> to repair the solar panels. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/after-rain-comes_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Required Materials\"></li><li>These materials can typically be found by looting or crafted if you have the schematics and raw resources.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Repair the Solar Panels</h2><p>Once you have the materials and are at the location, proceed with the repair.</p><ul><li>Head towards the quest objective marker, which will lead you to a set of solar panels on the ground.</li><li>Locate the interaction point, which looks like a small yellow box near the panels. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/after-rain-comes_2_00-21.jpg\" alt=\"Repair Objective\"></li><li>Interact with the objective to use your Wires and Batteries to complete the repair.</li><li>Once the repair is done, the 'After Rain Comes' quest will be marked as complete. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/after-rain-comes_3_00-27.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Completion\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide details how to complete the 'After Rain Comes' quest in Arc Raiders by locating and repairing the solar panels in the Grandioso Apartments area, including the required materials.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/after-rain-comes_3_00-27.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
