  {
    "id": "5a85fc6a-d1b6-49af-80ce-ccfe58e4fb1f",
    "title": "Armored Transports",
    "slug": "armored-transports",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>Finding the Armored Patrol Car can be challenging due to its random spawn locations. This guide will show you where to acquire the necessary key and all potential spawn points for the locked patrol cars in the Traffic Tunnels, helping you successfully complete the associated quest.</p><h2>Step 1: Obtain the Patrol Car Key</h2><ul><li>Start by navigating to the 'Checkpoint' area on the Blue Gate map. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_0_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Locate Checkpoint on Map\"></li><li>Proceed to the most left guard house within the Checkpoint area.</li><li>Inside, on a table, you will find a folder. Interact with it to obtain the 'Patrol Car Key'.</li><li><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> Place the Patrol Car Key into your safe pocket immediately. Losing this key will prevent you from completing the quest unless you find it again.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_2_00-24.jpg\" alt=\"Patrol Car Key Details\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Search Traffic Tunnels for Patrol Cars</h2><ul><li>Once you have the key, head towards the Traffic Tunnels. This area is easily accessible just along the main road from the Checkpoint. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_3_00-39.jpg\" alt=\"Entering Traffic Tunnels\"></li><li>The Armored Patrol Cars can spawn randomly throughout the tunnels. You will need to check various locations.</li></ul><h3>Possible Patrol Car Locations:</h3><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">The first possible spawn is right at the entrance of the Traffic Tunnel. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_4_00-50.jpg\" alt=\"First Patrol Car Spawn\"></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Check behind each armored patrol car you encounter. If the rear door is locked and requires the Patrol Car Key, you've found the correct one for your quest. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_5_00-59.jpg\" alt=\"Identifying Locked Patrol Car\"></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">There are multiple spawn points deeper inside the tunnels. Consult your map for general areas. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_6_01-02.jpg\" alt=\"Tunnel Patrol Car Map (General)\"><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_8_01-15.jpg\" alt=\"Tunnel Patrol Car Map (Closer)\"><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_9_01-33.jpg\" alt=\"Another Tunnel Patrol Car Map\"></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Continue further into the tunnel, checking both sides of the road. Be aware of ARC drones, fireball paps, and Bastions in this area.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Another common spawn point is right next to a large pillar within the tunnel. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_10_01-52.jpg\" alt=\"Pillar Patrol Car Map\"></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Proceed to the very end of the tunnel, as additional patrol cars can spawn there. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_11_02-16.jpg\" alt=\"All Random Spawn Points Map\"></li><li><strong>Note:</strong> Not all armored vehicles are the quest-specific patrol car; some will simply be junk vehicles or unlocked transports. Always look for the interaction prompt to use your Patrol Car Key on a locked rear door. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_12_02-26.jpg\" alt=\"Checking Rear Door Lock\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Accessing the Patrol Car</h2><ul><li>When you find a patrol car with a locked rear door, use your Patrol Car Key to open it.</li><li>Inside, you will find weapon crates. Loot these crates to receive a green or blue weapon, successfully completing the quest. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_7_01-09.jpg\" alt=\"Looting Locked Patrol Car\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides a walkthrough for finding the Armored Patrol Car and its key in Arc Raiders. Learn where to locate the key and all possible spawn points for the patrol cars to complete your quest.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/armored-transports_2_00-24.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Reach the Checkpoint",
      "Search the Guard huts for a Armored Patrol Key Card",
      "Reach the Traffic Tunnel near the Blue Gate Checkpoint",
      "Find and unlock the rear door of an armored patrol car"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
