  {
    "id": "8af69139-a32e-43fd-a86c-0481d640b169",
    "title": "Back on Top",
    "slug": "back-on-top",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>To complete you'll need to locate and interact with specific murals or marked walls across three different maps: Buried City, Dam Battlegrounds, Blue Gate, and Spacepoint.</p><h2>Step 1: Buried City Mural</h2><p>Your first stop is the Buried City map. Navigate to the northeastern building as indicated on the map.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_0_00-00.jpg\" alt=\"Buried City Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Locate the specific building in the northeast section of the Buried City map.</li><li>Once there, approach the building wall that features a distinct mural or graffiti.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_1_00-08.jpg\" alt=\"Approaching Buried City Mural\"></p><ul><li>Interact with this wall to complete the first part of the quest.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_2_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Interact with Buried City Mural\"></p><h2>Step 2: Dam Battlegrounds Mural (Pattern House)</h2><p>Next, head to the Dam Battlegrounds map. Your target is the Pattern House, located in the very northern part of the map.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_3_00-17.jpg\" alt=\"Dam Battlegrounds Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Find the Pattern House building, which requires some climbing to reach the upper level.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_4_00-22.jpg\" alt=\"Climbing to Pattern House\"></p><ul><li>Once inside or on the accessible part of the building, locate the interactable wall.</li><li>Interact with the wall to complete this section of the quest.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_5_00-27.jpg\" alt=\"Interact with Pattern House Wall\"></p><h2>Step 3: Blue Gate Mural (Warehouse Complex Tower)</h2><p>Proceed to the Blue Gate map. You'll need to find a tower situated next to the Warehouse Complex.</p><p><br></p><ul><li>Be cautious when approaching, as this area is often heavily guarded by drones.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_7_00-40.jpg\" alt=\"Approaching Blue Gate Tower\"></p><ul><li>Locate the ladder on the side of the tower and climb it to reach the upper sections.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_8_00-43.jpg\" alt=\"Climbing Tower Ladder\"></p><ul><li>At the top, find the specific wall on the tower that you can interact with.</li><li>Perform the interaction to progress your quest.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_9_00-49.jpg\" alt=\"Interact with Blue Gate Tower\"></p><h2>Step 4: Spacepoint Mural (South Trench Tower)</h2><p>Finally, travel to the Spacepoint map. Your objective here is the South Trench Tower.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_10_00-50.jpg\" alt=\"Spacepoint Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Head to the South Trench Tower, a prominent structure in the area.</li><li>Locate the wall on the tower that allows for interaction.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_11_00-58.jpg\" alt=\"Interact with South Trench Tower\"></p><ul><li>Interact with this final wall to successfully complete the entire quest line.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/back-on-top_1_00-08.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "On Dam Battlegrounds, mark the Pattern House",
      "On The Blue Gate, mark the white lookout tower south of the Warehouse Complex",
      "On Spaceport, mark the South Trench Tower",
      "On Buried City, mark the building with the mural in the Buried Properties"
    ],
