  {
    "id": "012273b7-55c4-4652-8553-b89d4e879803",
    "title": "Bees!",
    "slug": "bees",
    "content": "<p>This guide will walk you through the precise steps to complete the 'BEES' quest in Arc Raiders by locating and collecting the necessary bees in the Olive Grove area of The Blue Gate. No items need to be turned in after collection.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Quest Area on the Map</h2><p>Begin by opening your map to view your current quest objectives. The 'BEES' quest will direct you to a specific area within The Blue Gate region. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/bees_0_00-08.jpg\" alt=\"Map Quest Location\"></p><ul><li>Navigate to the 'BEES' quest under the 'THE BLUE GATE' section in your quest log.</li><li>Observe the highlighted area on your map, which indicates the general vicinity of the quest objective. The video shows the player already at the 'Olive Grove' location.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Pinpoint the Bee Location</h2><p>Once you are in the Olive Grove area, look for a partially ruined structure. The bees are discreetly located underneath a damaged overhang of one of these buildings.</p><ul><li>Approach the specific building shown in the video.</li><li>Look directly above you, underneath the structural overhang, to spot the glowing item marked as 'Collect'. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/bees_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Collect the Bees\"></li><li>Interact with the glowing item to collect the bees.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Quest Completion</h2><p>After collecting the bees, the quest will automatically complete. You do not need to turn in any physical items to an NPC or a specific drop-off point.</p><ul><li>Open your map again to confirm the 'BEES' quest is now marked as complete. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/bees_2_00-20.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Completion Confirmation\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides the exact location to find the 'bees' for the 'BEES' quest in the Blue Gate region, specifically within the Olive Grove.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/bees_0_00-08.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In One Round:",
      "Reach the Olive Grove in Blue Gate",
      "Search for bee hives around the Olive Grove"
    ],
