  {
    "id": "c1d69b4d-ed2a-486c-b67e-98e52c66ddae",
    "title": "Broken Monument",
    "slug": "broken-monument",
    "content": "<p>The 'Broken Monument' quest requires you to find three specific items: a Compass, a Videotape, and Old Field Rations. All of these items are found within the Scrap Yard area of the Dam Battlegrounds map, each hidden in small, rusted metal crates. The order in which you collect them does not matter. As you approach a quest item crate, a yellow pop-up will indicate \"Search for [item name]\".</p><h2>Step 1: Prepare for the Quest</h2><ul><li>Load into the <strong>Dam Battlegrounds</strong> map.</li><li>Open your map and locate the <strong>Scrap Yard</strong>, which is situated at the southern end, almost in the center of the map, below the Research &amp; Administration building. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_1_00-32.jpg\" alt=\"Scrap Yard Location\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Locate the Compass</h2><ul><li>Search for two large, gray metal containers that are stacked at an angle on top of one another, with three smaller red metal workbench-like structures in front of them. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_2_01-01.jpg\" alt=\"Compass Location (Overview)\"></li><li>Hop into the middle of these stacked containers. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_3_01-04.jpg\" alt=\"Compass Location (Exact)\"></li><li>You will find a rusted metal crate on the ground between the containers. Search it to obtain the <strong>Compass</strong>. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_4_01-08.jpg\" alt=\"Collecting the Compass\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Locate the Videotape</h2><ul><li>Look for two long, green silos (large cylindrical containers) that are tipped over and lying next to each other. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_5_01-21.jpg\" alt=\"Videotape Location (Overview)\"></li><li>On the side of one of these silos, you'll find another rusted metal crate. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_6_01-28.jpg\" alt=\"Videotape Location (Exact)\"></li><li>Open the crate to collect the <strong>Videotape</strong>. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_7_01-31.jpg\" alt=\"Collecting the Videotape\"></li></ul><h2>Step 4: Locate the Old Field Rations</h2><ul><li>Head northeast out of the main Scrap Yard area. You will encounter an old, abandoned mobile trailer-like structure. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_8_01-44.jpg\" alt=\"Field Rations Location (Overview)\"></li><li>Enter the trailer. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_9_01-49.jpg\" alt=\"Field Rations Location (Entering)\"></li><li>Inside, you will find a third rusted metal crate. Search it to collect the <strong>Old Field Rations</strong>. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_10_01-53.jpg\" alt=\"Collecting the Field Rations\"></li></ul><h2>Step 5: Important Completion Tips</h2><ul><li><strong>Physical Collection Required:</strong> Unlike some other quests, you must physically pick up the quest items from the crates after searching. They will appear in your backpack. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_11_02-23.jpg\" alt=\"Inventory Confirmation\"></li><li><strong>One Round Only:</strong> All three quest items must be found and collected within a single raid round. The quest tracker explicitly states \"IN ONE ROUND\". <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_12_02-38.jpg\" alt=\"One Round Requirement\"></li><li>Once all items are in your backpack, successfully extract from the raid to complete the 'Broken Monument' quest. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_13_04-58.jpg\" alt=\"Extraction for Quest Completion\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides step-by-step instructions on how to complete the 'Broken Monument' quest in Arc Raiders by locating the Compass, Videotape, and Old Field Rations within the Dam Battlegrounds map. Learn where each item is hidden and critical tips for successful quest completion.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/broken-monument_12_02-38.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In One Round",
      "Reach the hallowed grounds by the Scrap Yard",
      "Search for a compass near the broken-down vehicles",
      "Search for the video tape near the cylindrical containers",
      "Search for the old field rations in the Raider camp",
      "Deliver the First Wave Tape to Tian Wen",
      "Deliver First Wave Compass to Tian Wen",
      "Deliver First Wave Rations to Tian Wen"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
      {
