  {
    "id": "431e4e1c-ff83-4c45-87b5-e00bdefc39dd",
    "title": "Building a Library",
    "slug": "building-a-library",
    "content": "<h2>Overview: Building a Library Quest</h2><p>The 'Building a Library' quest requires you to find three specific books: a Tomebook, a Detectivebook, and an Adventurebook. All three are located within the Library building in Buried City.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Library in Buried City</h2><p>First, open your map and locate the Library icon in the Buried City area. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/building-a-library_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Library Location on Map\"> Once you've marked it, head towards the building. Upon entering, you'll find yourself in a large, somewhat dilapidated library structure.</p><h2>Step 2: Find the Tomebook</h2><ul><li>The first book, the Tomebook, can be found on the ground floor. After entering the main library area, look for a fallen bookshelf near a large pile of scattered books. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/building-a-library_1_00-10.jpg\" alt=\"First Book (Tomebook) Location\"></li><li>Approach the bookshelf and interact to collect the Tomebook. [SCREENSHOT:00:13] Ensure you pick it up to progress the quest.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Find the Detectivebook</h2><ul><li>From the first book's location, head further into the ground floor, navigating around the debris. You'll find another section with bookshelves lining the walls.</li><li>The second book, the Detectivebook, is on the ground near a bookshelf against a plain wall. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/building-a-library_2_00-22.jpg\" alt=\"Second Book (Detectivebook) Location\"></li><li>Collect the Detectivebook to add it to your inventory. [SCREENSHOT:00:25]</li></ul><h2>Step 4: Find the Adventurebook</h2><ul><li>For the third book, the Adventurebook, you need to go up to the second level of the library. Look for a staircase or ramp that leads upwards.</li><li>Once on the upper level, look over the railing. The Adventurebook is located on a small shelf directly below the railing you're looking over. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/building-a-library_3_00-30.jpg\" alt=\"Third Book (Adventurebook) Location\"> This one is often missed due to its position.</li><li>Descend to the lower level or find a safe way down to interact with and collect the Adventurebook. [SCREENSHOT:00:34]</li></ul><h2>Step 5: Deliver the Books</h2><p>With all three books collected, your quest objective will update to 'Deliver Travels to Apollo'. You can now proceed to Apollo to complete the 'Building a Library' quest.</p>",
    "summary": "This guide will walk you through finding all three books required to complete the 'Building a Library' quest in Arc Raiders, located within the Buried City.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/building-a-library_0_00-05.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In one round: Locate the Library in the City Center",
      "Find 1 romance book",
      "Find 1 detective book",
      "Find 1 adventure book",
      "Deliver 3 books to Apollo"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
