  {
    "id": "9ddf705d-09fe-4ee4-b699-f16002d4f0ff",
    "title": "Celeste's Journals",
    "slug": "celestes-journals",
    "content": "<p>To complete the 'Eyes in the Sky' quest, you need to find two distinct quest items located at specific outposts on the Dam Battlegrounds map. This guide will walk you through finding both items and securing them for quest completion.</p><h2>Step 1: First Quest Item (South Swamp Outpost)</h2><p>Your first objective is to head to the South Swamp Outpost. Open your map to pinpoint its location.</p><ul><li>Set a waypoint for the South Swamp Outpost, which is in the southern part of the map. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_1_00-04.jpg\" alt=\"South Swamp Outpost Map Location\"></li><li>Once you arrive at the outpost, look for a dilapidated tower-like building. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_2_00-06.jpg\" alt=\"First Item Location Entrance\"></li><li>Enter this wreckage building. Navigate through the dimly lit interior. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_3_00-13.jpg\" alt=\"First Item Bed Spot\"></li><li>The quest item, referred to as 'Quest Objective', is found on top of a bed inside this building. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_4_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"First Quest Item Found\"></li><li>Make sure to loot the item and place it in your safe pocket to ensure it is not lost upon death.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Second Quest Item (Raider Outpost East)</h2><p>For your second item, you'll need to travel to the Raider Outpost East, located in the northern region of the map.</p><ul><li>Open your map again and locate the Raider Outpost East. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_5_00-19.jpg\" alt=\"Raider Outpost East Map Location\"></li><li>Head towards this location, which is nestled in a more arid, rocky landscape. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_6_00-22.jpg\" alt=\"Second Item Location Entrance\"></li><li>Approach and enter the building at this outpost.</li><li>Inside the building, the second 'Quest Objective' item will be on a bed. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_7_00-33.jpg\" alt=\"Second Item Bed Spot\"></li><li>Confirm you have picked up the second 'Quest Objective' item. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_8_00-36.jpg\" alt=\"Second Quest Item Found\"></li><li>Don't forget to put this item into your safe pocket as well.</li></ul><h3>Step 3: Complete the Quest</h3><ul><li>Once both quest items are secured in your safe pocket, you have successfully completed the 'Celestes Journal' quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/celestes-journals_8_00-36.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Retreive Celeste's Journals from the South Swamp Outpost",
      "Retrieve Celeste's Journals from the northern outpost overlooking the Red Lakes",
      "Deliver 2 Journals to Celeste"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
