  {
    "id": "74febe04-2aa6-4c0d-80e0-a0ebb09661c7",
    "title": "Clearer Skies",
    "slug": "clearer-skies",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The \"Clearer Skies\" quest requires you to destroy 3 ARC enemies and collect 3 ARC Alloy to deliver to Shani. This guide outlines the steps to efficiently complete this mission.</p><h2>Step 1: Accept the \"Clearer Skies\" Quest</h2><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_0_00-00.jpg\" alt=\"Accept \"></p><ul><li>Access your Quests tab and locate \"Clearer Skies\".</li><li>Review the objectives: Destroy 3 ARC enemies and Get 3 ARC Alloy for Shani.</li><li>Accept the quest to begin.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Locate and Destroy ARC Enemies</h2><p>ARC enemies, typically drones for this quest, can be found throughout the map. You can actively search for them or wait for them to appear at specific points.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_1_00-11.jpg\" alt=\"Targeting an ARC Drone\"></p><ul><li>Identify an ARC drone in the environment.</li><li>Use a reliable weapon to shoot down the drone. Focus fire to destroy it quickly.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_2_00-14.jpg\" alt=\"Destroying an ARC Drone\"></p><ul><li>Confirm the drone has been destroyed.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Collect ARC Alloy</h2><p>Once an ARC enemy is destroyed, you need to loot its remains to collect the required ARC Alloy.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_3_00-18.jpg\" alt=\"Searching a Downed Drone\"></p><ul><li>Approach the downed ARC enemy and interact to search it.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_4_00-21.jpg\" alt=\"Looting ARC Powercell (Alloy)\"></p><ul><li>Locate the \"ARC Powercell\" (or ARC Alloy) item in the loot container.</li><li>Transfer at least one ARC Alloy into your safe pocket. Repeat this step until you have 3 ARC Alloy in total.</li></ul><h2>Step 4: Utilize Extraction Elevators for Additional Enemies</h2><p>A reliable method to encounter ARC drones is by activating an extraction elevator, which almost always attracts a drone to your location.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_5_00-28.jpg\" alt=\"Calling the Extraction Elevator\"></p><ul><li>Find an extraction elevator on the map.</li><li>Activate the elevator to initiate the extraction sequence.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_6_00-32.jpg\" alt=\"Drone Spawns at Elevator\"></p><ul><li>An ARC drone will likely spawn and engage you near the elevator.</li><li>Destroy this drone and loot it for additional ARC Alloy if needed.</li></ul><h2>Step 5: Extract and Complete the Quest</h2><p>Once you have successfully collected 3 ARC Alloy, you need to extract and return to Shani to complete the quest.</p><ul><li>Use an extraction elevator to return to your base.</li><li>Hand over the collected ARC Alloy to Shani to finalize the \"Clearer Skies\" quest.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_7_00-55.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Complete\"></p><ul><li>Claim your rewards after successful completion.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "A comprehensive guide to completing the \"Clearer Skies\" quest in Arc Raiders, including how to locate and destroy ARC enemies and retrieve ARC Alloy.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/clearer-skies_0_00-00.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Destroy 3 ARC enemies",
      "Get 3 ARC Alloy for Shani"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
      {
        "id": "0dc9c923-7399-4141-b75d-56b271e29dfa",
