  {
    "id": "8fd31a6c-44d5-4034-b55c-051d84a1cfcf",
    "title": "Cold Storage",
    "slug": "cold-storage",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'Cold Storage' quest requires you to locate and retrieve 'Welfare Blocks' from a specific container in the Lobby area's basement on the Stella Montis map. This guide provides a step-by-step route to the item's location.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Lobby Area</h2><p>Begin by navigating to the Lobby area on the Stella Montis map. This is highlighted on your map as the starting point for the 'Cold Storage' quest.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/cold-storage_0_00-00.jpg\" alt=\"Starting Location (Map)\"></p><h2>Step 2: Head to the Metro Entrance East</h2><ul><li>From the initial Lobby area, follow the path towards the 'Metro Entrance East' sign.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/cold-storage_1_00-08.jpg\" alt=\"Metro Entrance East\"></p><h2>Step 3: Descend to the Basement Level</h2><ul><li>Proceed down the first escalator.</li><li>Continue through the dark corridor.</li><li>Descend a second escalator to reach the lower basement level.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/cold-storage_2_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Second Escalator\"></p><h2>Step 4: Find the Quest Container</h2><ul><li>Once on the basement level, navigate through the area until you reach the 'Lobby Metro' train extract.</li><li>The container you need to interact with is located directly opposite the train extract.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/cold-storage_3_00-29.jpg\" alt=\"Container Location\"></p><h2>Step 5: Retrieve the Rare Books</h2><ul><li>Interact with the container to open it.</li><li>Pick up the 'Rare Books' quest item.</li><li>Ensure you place the Rare Books into your safe pocket to secure them for extraction and delivery.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/cold-storage_4_00-34.jpg\" alt=\"Interacting with Container\"></p><h2>Step 6: Deliver to Shani</h2><ul><li>With the Rare Books secured in your safe pocket, successfully extract from the map.</li><li>Deliver the Welfare Blocks to Shani to complete the 'Cold Storage' quest.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/cold-storage_5_00-40.jpg\" alt=\"Welfare Blocks in Safe Pocket\"></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/cold-storage_4_00-34.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In one round",
      "Search any J Kozma Ventures Container"
    ],
