  {
    "id": "3d458c61-1b92-4174-b171-212cfc419995",
    "title": "Communication Hideout",
    "slug": "communication-hideout",
    "content": "<p>This guide will walk you through the 'Communication Hideout' quest. You'll need to find a missing battery cell, install it into a generator, power up the generator, and finally boost an antenna terminal.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate and Retrieve the Battery Cell</h2><p>Begin your quest in Old Town, near the Red Tower. The Communication Hideout objective is highlighted on your map.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/communication-hideout_0_00-06.jpg\" alt=\"Initial Quest Location\"></p><ul><li>Navigate to the specified location on your map, in the area of Old Town near the Red Tower.</li><li>Look for a small, dilapidated structure nestled in the sandy area near a wall.</li><li>Approach the container located next to this structure.</li><li>Interact with the container to retrieve the missing battery cell.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/communication-hideout_1_00-12.jpg\" alt=\"Retrieve Battery Cell\"></p><h2>Step 2: Power the Generator</h2><p>Once you have the battery cell, your next objective is to install it into the nearby generator and power it on.</p><ul><li>Locate the generator, which is a truck-like object with a blinking red light, situated on the cobblestone path near where you found the battery.</li><li>Approach the generator and interact with it to install the battery cell.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/communication-hideout_2_00-20.jpg\" alt=\"Install Battery\"></p><ul><li>After installing the battery, interact with the generator again to turn on the power.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/communication-hideout_3_00-24.jpg\" alt=\"Enable Generator Power\"></p><h2>Step 3: Activate the Antenna Terminal</h2><p>With power restored, your final task is to reach the antenna terminal on the Red Tower and boost it.</p><ul><li>Head towards the building adjacent to the generator. You'll need to enter it to reach the upper levels.</li><li>Look for an open window at ground level and climb through it.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/communication-hideout_4_00-31.jpg\" alt=\"Enter Building\"></p><ul><li>Once inside, navigate through the building and climb the stairs to ascend.</li><li>Reach the rooftop area and locate a ladder.</li><li>Climb the ladder to reach the higher section of the rooftop.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/communication-hideout_5_00-36.jpg\" alt=\"Climb to Rooftop\"></p><ul><li>Move around the corner on the rooftop until you find the external antenna terminal.</li><li>Interact with the terminal to boost it, completing the 'Communication Hideout' quest.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/communication-hideout_6_00-42.jpg\" alt=\"Activate Antenna Terminal\"></p>",
    "summary": "A detailed walkthrough for completing the 'Communication Hideout' quest in Arc Raiders, covering battery retrieval, generator activation, and antenna terminal boosting.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/communication-hideout_0_00-06.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
