  {
    "id": "fcf6009e-7d57-46e0-9bf7-25e79cf04990",
    "title": "Controlled Demolition",
    "slug": "controlled-demolition",
    "content": "<p>Completing the \"Controlled Demolition\" quest requires you to find two Explosive Mixtures for Apollo. This guide will show you the optimal locations and steps to efficiently gather these items.</p><h2>Step 1: Identify Industrial Locations</h2><p>Explosive Mixtures are commonly found in Industrial areas. The easiest locations to find them are:</p><ul><li><strong>Water Treatment Control:</strong> This location is generally less contested and marked on your map. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/controlled-demolition_0_00-01.jpg\" alt=\"Locate Water Treatment Control\"></li><li><strong>Hydroponic Dome Complex:</strong> This is an alternative Industrial area, but be cautious as it is often highly contested by other players.</li><li>Look for areas on your map with the specific 'Industrial' icon in the legend to pinpoint these locations. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/controlled-demolition_1_00-06.jpg\" alt=\"Identify Industrial Areas on Map\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Collect Explosive Mixtures</h2><p>Once you are in an industrial area, begin searching containers and interactable objects for the Explosive Mixtures.</p><ul><li>Actively search through crates, shelves, and other environmental containers. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/controlled-demolition_2_00-13.jpg\" alt=\"Search In-Game for Items\"></li><li>When you find an Explosive Mixture, it will appear in your inventory. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/controlled-demolition_3_00-19.jpg\" alt=\"Explosive Mixture in Inventory\"> Remember, you don't have to get both in a single run; you can always return in another raid.</li><li>Crucially, ensure you place any Explosive Mixtures you find into your safe container before extracting to guarantee they are secured for the quest.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Complete the \"Controlled Demolition\" Quest</h2><p>After successfully acquiring and securing two Explosive Mixtures, return to Apollo to complete the quest.</p><ul><li>Navigate to the \"Quests\" tab under Apollo's vendor screen.</li><li>Claim your rewards for completing the \"Controlled Demolition\" quest. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/controlled-demolition_4_00-30.jpg\" alt=\"Claim Quest Rewards\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 5000",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/controlled-demolition_4_00-30.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [],
