  {
    "id": "3a390a85-3400-4811-8e37-9bf077125dc0",
    "title": "Digging Up Dirt",
    "slug": "digging-up-dirt",
    "content": "<p>To complete the 'Digging Up Dirt' quest and locate the Dead Drop, follow these steps to navigate to the correct building in Old Town and find the hidden drop point.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate Santa Maria Houses in Old Town</h2><p>Open your map and navigate to the Old Town area. Look for the specific section marked as 'Santa Maria Houses'. This is the general vicinity where you need to be.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/digging-up-dirt_0_00-07.jpg\" alt=\"Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Zoom in on the map to clearly see the 'Old Town' section.</li><li>Pinpoint the 'Santa Maria Houses' location on the map.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Enter the Building via the Roof</h2><p>Once you are on the roof of the building indicated in the map, look for an open access point or a hole that allows you to drop inside. The entry point is specifically on top of the 'Santa Maria Houses' structure.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/digging-up-dirt_1_00-10.jpg\" alt=\"Roof Entry Point\"></p><ul><li>Make your way to the top of the Santa Maria Houses building.</li><li>Identify the open section on the roof through which you can drop down.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Descend into the Courtyard</h2><p>After the initial drop, you will be in an upper section of the building. Look for another opening in the floor to drop further down into the main courtyard area. Carefully make your way down to avoid fall damage.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/digging-up-dirt_2_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Second Drop to Courtyard\"></p><ul><li>Drop down through the first roof opening.</li><li>Locate the second opening in the floor to descend into the courtyard.</li></ul><h2>Step 4: Find and Interact with the Dead Drop</h2><p>Once you've reached the ground floor of the courtyard, look for a distinct pillar-like object. This is the Dead Drop you need to interact with to complete the quest objective.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/digging-up-dirt_3_00-18.jpg\" alt=\"Dead Drop Interaction\"></p><ul><li>Walk to the center of the courtyard.</li><li>Interact with the pillar to search the Dead Drop and complete the quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides a detailed walkthrough to locate the Dead Drop for the 'Digging Up Dirt' quest in Arc Raiders, found within the Santa Maria Houses in Old Town.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/digging-up-dirt_0_00-07.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Locate the Santa Maria Houses in Old Town",
      "Locate the Dead Drop inside the Santa Maria Houses in Old Town"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
      {
        "id": "ad905b93-7480-46bf-917d-20bc80c7de64",
        "item": {
          "id": "advanced-electrical-components",
