  {
    "id": "2005e9d4-d4fb-4890-952f-c831063145ad",
    "title": "Doctor's Orders",
    "slug": "doctors-orders",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>This guide will show you the easiest locations to find Antiseptic, Syringes, and Great Mullin herbs to aid your survival and crafting needs in Arc Raiders.</p><h2>Step 1: Locating Antiseptic &amp; Syringes</h2><ul><li>The easiest way to find Antiseptic and Syringes is by visiting the Pharmacy located in the Buried City map.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_0_00-02.jpg\" alt=\"Pharmacy Location\"></li><li>Set a waypoint to the Pharmacy in the Buried City area.</li><li>The entrance door to the Pharmacy will need to be breached. Interact with the door to initiate the breach sequence.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_1_00-10.jpg\" alt=\"Breaching Pharmacy Door\"></li><li>Once inside, you will find various medical supplies, including Antiseptic and Syringes, laying on the shelves and counters.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_2_00-28.jpg\" alt=\"Pharmacy Counter Items\"></li><li>Be sure to also check the main counter for a quest item related to a future quest called 'Reveal in Ruins'.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_3_00-31.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Item\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Finding Great Mullin Herbs</h2><ul><li>For abundant Great Mullin herbs, head to the Dam map.</li><li>Specifically, go to the Testing Annex building. You can see its location near the Electrical Tower on your map.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_6_00-56.jpg\" alt=\"Dam Map Location\"></li><li>Once at the Testing Annex, look for the entrance that leads to the lower floors.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_7_01-00.jpg\" alt=\"Entering Testing Annex\"></li><li>The lower floors are covered with water, and you will find a large number of Great Mullin herbs growing in these flooded areas, ready for harvesting.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_4_00-48.jpg\" alt=\"Harvesting Great Mullin\"></li><li>These herbs can be recycled into chemicals, making them a valuable crafting resource.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_5_00-53.jpg\" alt=\"Great Mullin in Inventory\"></li><li>Navigate through the submerged corridors of the Testing Annex to collect as many Great Mullin herbs as you need.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/doctors-orders_9_01-21.jpg\" alt=\"Flooded Annex Interior\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "A concise guide on efficiently locating essential medical supplies like Antiseptic and Syringes, as well as crafting herbs such as Great Mullin in Arc Raiders.",
    "thumbnail_url": null,
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Obtain 1 Syringe",
      "Obtain 2 Antiseptic",
      "Obtain 1 Durable Cloth",
      "Obtain 1 Great Mullein"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
