  {
    "id": "0685006a-22c9-4a75-afd3-4f3dbed7b735",
    "title": "Dormant Barons",
    "slug": "dormant-barons",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>To complete the 'Dormant Barons' quest, you'll need to find and interact with a specific type of structure known as a Barn Husk. This guide provides the exact location and steps to successfully loot it.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Barn Husk</h2><ul><li>First, open your map to pinpoint the general area. The Barn Husk is located at the breach on the Dam Battlegrounds. You can see the location on the map here: <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/dormant-barons_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Map Location\"></li><li>Once you arrive at the Dam, look for a large, overturned, metallic structure that is partially covered in vines. This is your Barn Husk. You can see it clearly from this vantage point: <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/dormant-barons_1_00-11.jpg\" alt=\"Identifying the Barn Husk\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Initiate the Breach</h2><ul><li>Approach the center of the Barn Husk.</li><li>You will find an interaction prompt (usually 'E') to 'Breach' it. Activate the breach. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/dormant-barons_2_00-17.jpg\" alt=\"Breaching the Husk\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Wait for Activation</h2><ul><li>After initiating the breach, the Barn Husk will begin a noisy and fiery activation sequence. It will emit smoke and burn, dealing damage if you are too close. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/dormant-barons_3_00-30.jpg\" alt=\"Barn Husk Activation\"></li><li>Maintain a safe distance and wait for the entire sequence to complete. This can take a short while, so be patient.</li></ul><h2>Step 4: Loot the Husk</h2><ul><li>Once all the smoke and burning has stopped and the central compartment is fully open, approach the husk again. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/dormant-barons_4_00-44.jpg\" alt=\"Looting the Husk\"></li><li>You can now safely loot the contents within the opened Barn Husk, which will complete your quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide details how to locate and loot a Barn Husk to complete the 'Dormant Barons' quest in Arc Raiders.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/dormant-barons_2_00-17.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Find and loot a Baron Husk"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
      {
