  {
    "id": "1989f530-8b78-4e1b-a648-3b2b1d95c0d2",
    "title": "Down To Earth",
    "slug": "down-to-earth",
    "content": "<h2>Overview: Down to Earth Quest</h2><p>The 'Down to Earth' quest requires you to:</p><ul><li>Visit a Field Depot</li><li>Deliver a Field Crate to a Field Depot</li><li>Collect the reward</li></ul><p>Upon completion, you will be granted a Combat Mk 1 Augment and a Medium Shield.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Field Depot</h2><p>This quest is most easily completed on the Dam Battlegrounds map. Select 'Dam Battlegrounds' from the map selection screen and click 'Confirm'.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_0_00-43.jpg\" alt=\"Select Dam Battlegrounds\"></p><p>Once on the Dam Battlegrounds map, locate the Field Depot. A reliable location for a Field Depot is near the 'Electrical Substation' and 'Water Towers' area. You'll be looking for a building with a satellite dish on top.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_1_00-54.jpg\" alt=\"Field Depot Map Location\"></p><p>Set a waypoint to this location and head there.</p><h2>Step 2: Approach the Field Depot</h2><p>As you approach the specified location, you will see a building with a large satellite dish on top, indicating it is a Field Depot.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_2_01-10.jpg\" alt=\"Field Depot Exterior\"></p><p>The entrance to the depot is at ground level. Enter the building.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_4_01-27.jpg\" alt=\"Entering Field Depot\"></p><h2>Step 3: Find and Deliver the Field Crate</h2><p>Inside the Field Depot, you will find a delivery terminal. This is where you will deliver the Field Crate. The most challenging part of this quest is locating the Field Crate itself, as its spawn location is randomized each time within the vicinity of the Field Depot.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_5_01-29.jpg\" alt=\"Delivery Terminal\"></p><ul><li>Exit the Field Depot and search the surrounding area carefully. Field Crates can be found inside nearby small buildings or out in the open.</li><li>Once you find the Field Crate, interact with it to pick it up. In this example, it was found in a nearby circular building next to the depot.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_6_01-51.jpg\" alt=\"Field Crate Location\"></p><ul><li>With the Field Crate in hand, return to the Field Depot.</li><li>Approach the delivery terminal inside the depot and interact with it to 'Deliver Fieldcrate'.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_8_02-18.jpg\" alt=\"Deliver Field Crate\"></p><h2>Step 4: Collect Your Rewards</h2><p>After successfully delivering the Field Crate, the quest objective will update. Interact with the same terminal again to 'Search' it.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_9_02-35.jpg\" alt=\"Claim Rewards\"></p><p>This will open your inventory, allowing you to claim your rewards: the Combat Mk 1 Augment and the Medium Shield when turning in the quest, along with any other miscellaneous loot found in the container.</p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/down-to-earth_8_02-18.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "All Objectives in one round",
      "Visit a Field Depot",
      "Deliver a Field Crate to a Supply Station",
      "Collect the reward"
    ],
