  {
    "id": "c1aa0e2e-7aca-4e28-b823-75429084d7b3",
    "title": "Echoes of Victory Ridge",
    "slug": "echoes-of-victory-ridge",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>This guide will walk you through the 'Echoes of Victory Ridge' quest, showing you precisely where to find the required item and how to extract efficiently. Remember, you must exfil with the mission item for the quest to count, so focus on this objective once you have it.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Objective Area</h2><ul><li>Head to the Dam Battlegrounds map.</li><li>Your target is the 'West Broken Bridge' waypoint, located at the very top of the map.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/echoes-of-victory-ridge_0_00-27.jpg\" alt=\"Map Location: West Broken Bridge\"></p><h2>Step 2: Find the Mission Item</h2><ul><li>Once you are near the West Broken Bridge, face North. You'll see the broken highway section off to your left, with several wrecked cars.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/echoes-of-victory-ridge_1_00-38.jpg\" alt=\"Approach the Broken Highway\"></p><ul><li>Do a 180-degree turn. You'll spot a couple of red cars and a blue car. There's also a large broken piece of highway tilted upwards.</li><li>Go underneath this tilted highway section.</li><li>Beneath it, you will find a rusted metal crate containing the 'Major Aivas Patch' quest item. Interact with the crate to collect it.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/echoes-of-victory-ridge_2_00-46.jpg\" alt=\"Retrieve the Mission Item\"></p><h2>Step 3: Extract the Item</h2><ul><li>After picking up the 'Major Aivas Patch', it will appear in your inventory.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/echoes-of-victory-ridge_3_00-52.jpg\" alt=\"Confirm Mission Item in Inventory\"></p><ul><li>Your priority is now to extract. Head straight to the nearest lift extraction point.</li><li>A good option is the Cargo Elevator (Northmost North Complex Elevator) if you are in the vicinity, or use any other available lift.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/echoes-of-victory-ridge_4_01-01.jpg\" alt=\"Exfil Route on Map\"></p><ul><li>Activate the elevator and successfully exfil to complete the quest.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/echoes-of-victory-ridge_5_01-17.jpg\" alt=\"Successful Extraction\"></p>",
    "summary": "A quick guide to completing the 'Echoes of Victory Ridge' quest in Arc Raiders. Learn the exact location of the mission item and the best way to extract quickly.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/echoes-of-victory-ridge_4_01-01.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In One Round:",
      "Reach Victory Ridge.",
      "Retrieve the battle plans from the hideout under the broken highway.",
      "Deliver Major Aiva's Patch to Celeste."
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
