  {
    "id": "da8c6777-b06c-4358-9a14-05e97310bc39",
    "title": "Espresso",
    "slug": "espresso",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'Espresso' quest requires you to find an espresso machine to salvage for spare parts. This guide will show you exactly where to go in Buried City and how to ensure you successfully collect the parts.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Espresso Machine</h2><ul><li>Open your map and navigate to the Buried City area.</li><li>Locate the Plaza Rosa section on the far south side of Buried City. This is where the espresso machine is found. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/espresso_0_00-07.jpg\" alt=\"Map Location\"></li><li>Head towards the building marked on your map in the Plaza Rosa area. It has a 'CAFFE' sign above the entrance. [SCREENSHOT:00:09]</li><li>Enter the building through the front door.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Collect the Parts</h2><ul><li>Once inside, proceed slightly forward and to the right.</li><li>You will find the 'Espresso Machine Parts' on a counter next to some shelves. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/espresso_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Espresso Machine Parts Found\"></li><li>Interact with the machine to pick up the parts.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Secure for Extraction</h2><ul><li>After picking up the 'Espresso Machine Parts', open your inventory.</li><li>Drag the Espresso Machine Parts from your backpack into your 'Safe Pocket' to ensure they are extracted safely, even if you are defeated. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/espresso_2_00-25.jpg\" alt=\"Place in Safe Pocket\"></li><li>You have now successfully found and secured the Espresso Machine Parts for the quest. Proceed to extract from the zone to complete the quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide details the steps to find the Espresso Machine Parts needed to complete the 'Espresso' quest in Buried City. Learn the exact location and how to secure the items for successful extraction.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/espresso_1_00-15.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In One Round:",
      "Find an espresso machine to salvage for spare parts",
      "Get the Espresso Machine Parts for Apollo"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
      {
