  {
    "id": "e3f57f6e-638d-4c70-9c60-be9629cf5de9",
    "title": "Eyes in the Sky",
    "slug": "eyes-in-the-sky",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'Eyes in the Sky' quest requires you to install three Lidar scanners across different areas of the map: Buried City, Dam Battlegrounds, and Spaceport. This guide will walk you through each location and the process of placing the scanner.</p><h2>Step 1: Buried City Galleria Lidar Scanner</h2><p>This is the first location for installing a Lidar scanner. Note you will need to bring a zipline. You can craft or buy these, or get lucky on a free loadout</p><ul><li>Open your map and locate the Galleria building in Buried City. It's marked as a commercial building. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-in-the-sky_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Buried City Galleria Map Location\"></li><li>To reach the top of the Galleria, you will need to use a zipline. Carefully place your zipline launcher to ascend to the higher levels of the building. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-in-the-sky_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Ascending Galleria with Zipline\"></li><li>Once on the top platform, navigate to the designated spot marked for scanner placement.</li><li>Interact to place the Lidar scanner. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-in-the-sky_2_00-23.jpg\" alt=\"Placing Scanner at Galleria\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Dam Battlegrounds Control Tower Lidar Scanner</h2><p>The second scanner needs to be installed at the Control Tower in Dam Battlegrounds.</p><ul><li>Access your map and find the Control Tower location in Dam Battlegrounds. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-in-the-sky_3_00-37.jpg\" alt=\"Dam Battlegrounds Control Tower Map Location\"></li><li>Head to the Control Tower. You'll need to use the elevator shaft to get to the top, being mindful of any turrets.</li><li>Once on the rooftop, clear any enemy resistance, including the 'bullies' (heavy enemies).</li><li>Proceed to the corner of the rooftop where you will find the placement spot for the scanner.</li><li>Install the Lidar scanner. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-in-the-sky_4_00-51.jpg\" alt=\"Placing Scanner at Control Tower\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Spaceport Communications Tower Lidar Scanner</h2><p>The final scanner is located at the Communications Tower in Spaceport.</p><ul><li>Open your map and pinpoint the Communications Tower within the Spaceport area, located on the far east side. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-in-the-sky_5_01-06.jpg\" alt=\"Spaceport Communications Tower Map Location\"></li><li>Reach the base of the tower and begin your ascent.</li><li>Climb the ladders to reach the top platform of the Communications Tower. [SCREENSHOT:01:08]</li><li>At the top, locate the marked spot for the scanner installation.</li><li>Place the final Lidar scanner to complete the quest. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-in-the-sky_6_01-12.jpg\" alt=\"Placing Scanner at Communications Tower\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-in-the-sky_1_00-15.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "On Dam Battlegrounds, install a LiDAR Scanner at the top of the Control Tower",
      "On Spaceport, install a LiDAR Scanner at the Communications Tower",
      "On Buried City, install a LiDAR Scanner on top of the Galleria sign"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
