  {
    "id": "12b48bfb-1237-48f2-9c2f-dda94e01c12c",
    "title": "Eyes on the Prize",
    "slug": "eyes-on-the-prize",
    "content": "<p>This guide will help you quickly complete the 'Eyes on the Price' quest in Arc Raiders, which involves finding a specific location, gathering three wires, and repairing a thruster panel.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Secluded Roof Terrace</h2><ul><li>First, open your map and ensure the 'Eyes on the Price' quest is active. The objective is to find the secluded roof terrace south-west of the Southern Station.</li><li>Navigate to the Southern Station area in Buried City. Look for the waypoint on your map, which marks the exact building you need to reach. This area is typically found around the Plaza Rosa region.</li><li><br></li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-on-the-prize_0_00-07.jpg\" alt=\"Southern Station Location\"></li><li>Once you are near the Southern Station, make your way onto the rooftops. You'll need to reach a specific 'Secluded Roof Terrace' to progress.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-on-the-prize_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Reaching Secluded Roof Terrace\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Acquire Three Wires</h2><ul><li>Upon reaching the Secluded Roof Terrace, your objective will update to 'Repair Thruster Panel using 3 Wires.'</li><li>Search the immediate area for lootable items. The wires can often be found in nearby containers or piles of junk. The video example shows the player looting a pile of debris on the terrace to acquire the wires.</li><li><br></li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-on-the-prize_2_00-18.jpg\" alt=\"Looting for Wires\"></li><li>Make sure you have at least three wires in your inventory before proceeding.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Repair the Thruster Panel</h2><ul><li>Locate the thruster panel on the secluded roof terrace. It typically looks like an electrical box or mechanism.</li><li>Interact with the panel to initiate the repair. You will use the three wires you collected.</li><li><br></li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-on-the-prize_3_00-22.jpg\" alt=\"Repairing Thruster Panel\"></li><li>Once repaired, the 'Eyes on the Price' quest will be marked as complete.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-on-the-prize_4_00-26.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Completion on Map\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides a detailed walkthrough for completing the 'Eyes on the Price' quest in Arc Raiders, including locating the necessary area, acquiring wires, and repairing the thruster panel.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/eyes-on-the-prize_0_00-07.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Find the secluded roof terrace south-west of the Southern Station, look for blue tarps.",
      "Rewire the solar panel using 3 Wires."
    ],
