  {
    "id": "3d2adb99-3172-4c54-9aeb-16e1093a3eeb",
    "title": "Finders Keepers",
    "slug": "finders-keepers",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'Finders Keepers' quest requires you to loot 3 containers in any Raider camp. Raider camps are not explicitly marked on your map, but there are specific locations you can visit to complete this objective easily.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Dam Raider Camp</h2><p>One of the most reliable locations for finding Raider camp containers is the Dam. You can find this location on your map:</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/finders-keepers_0_00-07.jpg\" alt=\"Dam Raider Camp Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Open your map and navigate to the Dam location.</li><li>Head towards the large, ruined structure that resembles a dam or power plant.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Loot Containers at the Dam</h2><p>Once you arrive at the Dam, enter the facility. There are multiple containers scattered throughout. Even if a container appears to be already looted, interacting with it again will still count towards your quest progression.</p><ul><li>Enter the Dam facility and search the immediate area. You will find containers on tables or on the ground.</li><li>Interact with the containers by pressing 'E' to search them.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/finders-keepers_1_00-18.jpg\" alt=\"First Dam Container Looted\"></p><ul><li>Continue through the facility, looting additional containers. There are several within close proximity.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/finders-keepers_2_00-25.jpg\" alt=\"Third Dam Container Looted\"></p><ul><li>After looting three containers, your quest objective 'Loot 3 containers in any Raider camp' will be completed.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Alternative: Hydroponic Dome Complex</h2><p>If you prefer an alternative location or need more containers, the Hydroponic Dome Complex, also known as the Field Depot, is another excellent spot.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/finders-keepers_3_00-48.jpg\" alt=\"Hydroponic Dome Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Locate the Hydroponic Dome Complex / Field Depot on your map. This area is typically a hotspot for supplies.</li><li>Head to this location and look for containers inside the structures.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/finders-keepers_4_00-53.jpg\" alt=\"Hydroponic Dome Container Loot\"></p><ul><li>Interact with the containers you find here. Similar to the Dam, re-looting already opened containers will count towards your quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "A quick guide to completing the 'Finders Keepers' quest by locating and looting containers in Raider Camps across the Arc Raiders world. This guide highlights two main locations and an important trick for quest progression.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/finders-keepers_0_00-07.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Loot 3x Containers in any Raider camp."
    ],
    "xp": 8000,
    "rewards": [
