  {
    "id": "6272b4f3-b3e5-4c54-b223-1f90c8b1c1dc",
    "title": "Flickering Threat",
    "slug": "flickering-threat",
    "content": "<p>This guide will walk you through the 'Flickering Threat' quest, showing you how to find the objectives and complete them efficiently.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Quest Area</h2><ul><li>Open your map and select the 'Flickering Threat' quest, which is located in the Dam Battlegrounds area. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/flickering-threat_0_00-04.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Map Location\"></li><li>The quest objective will be within the Hydroponic Comms Complex, specifically near the 'North Complex: Elevator' extract point.</li><li>Once you're at the North Complex: Elevator extract, you can either use the stairs to go down or simply drop straight down into the area below. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/flickering-threat_1_00-10.jpg\" alt=\"Generator Room Entrance\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Repair the Generator</h2><ul><li>Once inside the main facility, you will see a large generator.</li><li>To repair this generator, you will need exactly four wires. Make sure you have these items in your inventory before attempting the repair. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/flickering-threat_2_00-18.jpg\" alt=\"Repairing the Generator\"></li><li>Interact with the generator to repair it. A message will confirm the generator is now operational.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Find and Activate the Ventilation Shaft Power Switch</h2><ul><li>After repairing the generator, your next objective is to find the ventilation shaft.</li><li>Head through the facility, following the path past the generator.</li><li>You'll come across a door; activate it to proceed. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/flickering-threat_3_00-33.jpg\" alt=\"Path to Ventilation Shaft\"></li><li>Continue through the newly opened door and up a set of stairs.</li><li>At the top of the stairs, activate another door to continue your path.</li><li>Follow the corridor, turning around the corner.</li><li>You will enter a larger, somewhat open area with scattered debris.</li><li>Look for a yellow electrical box on the wall. This is the power switch for the ventilation shaft. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/flickering-threat_4_00-46.jpg\" alt=\"Ventilation Shaft Power Switch\"></li><li>Interact with the switch to enable the power. The light on the switch will turn green, indicating success.</li><li>Your quest, 'Flickering Threat', should now be completed. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/flickering-threat_5_00-51.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Completion\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides a detailed walkthrough for completing the 'Flickering Threat' quest in Arc Raiders. It covers locating the generator room, repairing the generator, finding the ventilation shaft, and activating the power switch.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/flickering-threat_5_00-51.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Enter the Power Generation Complex by The Dam",
      "Find the Generator Room",
      "Repair the Generator",
      "Find the Ventilation Shaft",
      "Enable the power via the power switch undernearth the stairs"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
