  {
    "id": "d4c102cd-9217-442a-b838-95627353e5b2",
    "title": "From a Distance",
    "slug": "from-a-distance",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'From a Distance' quest requires you to ping a Bastion and a Rocketeer from a significant distance. The Spaceport map offers an excellent high vantage point that makes this quest straightforward and quick to complete.</p><h2>Step 1: Select The Spaceport Map</h2><ul><li>Choose 'The Spaceport' as your destination for this mission. While other maps like Buried City also have these enemies, The Spaceport provides an ideal high-ground position.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/from-a-distance_0_00-02.jpg\" alt=\"Select The Spaceport Map\"></p><h2>Step 2: Navigate to the High Vantage Point</h2><ul><li>Once you've loaded into The Spaceport map, open your map to locate the 'Launch Towers' and 'Rocket Assembly' areas in the middle of the map. This general area is where you'll find the targets.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/from-a-distance_1_00-07.jpg\" alt=\"Locate High Vantage Point\"></p><ul><li>Head towards the high ground near the 'Launch Towers'. Follow the path shown in the video, moving towards the tall structure in the distance.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/from-a-distance_2_00-13.jpg\" alt=\"Approach Vantage Point\"></p><ul><li>Look for a ladder attached to a tall, rusty structure. Climb this ladder to gain elevation.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/from-a-distance_3_00-20.jpg\" alt=\"Climb to Elevated Structure\"></p><ul><li>Continue upwards and navigate through the interior of the structure.</li><li>Once outside, follow the metal walkways, making your way to the edge that offers a clear view of the surrounding area.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/from-a-distance_4_00-32.jpg\" alt=\"Navigate Elevated Walkway\"></p><h2>Step 3: Ping the Targets</h2><ul><li>Reach the end of the walkway, near the location marked as 'Control Watch' or 'Shipping Warehouse' on your map (as seen on the map overlay). This elevated position will give you a clear line of sight to the quest targets.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/from-a-distance_5_00-46.jpg\" alt=\"Target the Bastion\"></p><ul><li>From this vantage point, you should be able to spot both a Bison and a Rocketeer in the distance. Aim at the Bison and use your ping command.</li><li>Next, locate the Rocketeer (often flying or patrolling) and ping it as well.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/from-a-distance_6_00-54.jpg\" alt=\"Ping the Rocketeer\"></p><ul><li>Successfully pinging both enemies from this distance will complete the 'From a Distance' quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides an efficient strategy to complete the 'From a Distance' quest in Arc Raiders, focusing on using a high vantage point on The Spaceport map to successfully ping both a Bison and a Rocketeer.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/from-a-distance_1_00-07.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Ping 1x Rocketeer",
      "Ping 1x Bison"
    ],
    "xp": 10000,
    "rewards": [
      {
        "id": "3e0957ba-d367-497a-ae98-512849c183d1",
        "item": {
          "id": "photoelectric-cloak",
          "icon": "https://cdn.metaforge.app/arc-raiders/icons/photoelectric-cloak.webp",
          "name": "Photoelectric Cloak",
          "rarity": "Epic",
          "item_type": "Quick Use"
        },
        "item_id": "photoelectric-cloak",
        "quantity": "1"
