  {
    "id": "f90c79c5-ee0a-4671-8245-d37ccc103a50",
    "title": "Greasing Her Palms",
    "slug": "greasing-her-palms",
    "content": "<h2>Greasing Her Palms Quest Overview</h2><p>The 'Greasing Her Palms' quest requires you to visit specific locations on three different maps: Dam Battlegrounds, Buried City, and Spaceport. You'll need to use a key for one location and breach barricades for another, before finally scoping out rocket thrusters. Completing this quest will grant you valuable rewards.</p><h2>Step 1: Dam Battlegrounds Objective</h2><p>This part of the quest involves visiting the locked room in the Water Treatment Control building on the Dam Battlegrounds map.</p><ul><li>First, check your quest details in the menu to confirm the objectives and received items. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_0_00-07.jpg\" alt=\"View Quest Details\"></li><li>You will be granted a specific key for this part of the quest: the Dam Surveillance Key. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Dam Surveillance Key\"></li><li>Ensure you place the Dam Surveillance Key into your Safe Pocket from your Stash before starting your raid to prevent losing it if you die. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_2_00-23.jpg\" alt=\"Equip Key in Safe Pocket\"></li><li>Locate the Water Treatment Control building on your map. It is a labeled building. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_3_00-39.jpg\" alt=\"Water Treatment Control Location\"></li><li>Approach the building from the southwest. Look for a gap between the buildings with stairs. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_4_00-58.jpg\" alt=\"Stairs to Water Treatment Entrance\"></li><li>Go up the first flight of stairs and enter the door on your right. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_5_01-03.jpg\" alt=\"Locked Door in Water Treatment\"></li><li>Inside, you will find a locked door with a red keycard slot. Use your Dam Surveillance Key to open it. [SCREENSHOT:01:06]</li><li>Enter the opened room. There is often good loot inside, so ensure you have inventory space. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_6_01-17.jpg\" alt=\"Inside the Locked Room\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Buried City Objective</h2><p>For the Buried City objective, you need to visit the barricaded room on the 6th floor of the Space Travel building.</p><ul><li>Open your map and locate the Space Travel building in Buried City. It is a labeled landmark. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_7_01-25.jpg\" alt=\"Space Travel Building Location\"></li><li>Once you get top-side in your raid, place a waypoint and head towards the building.</li><li>Enter the building through any accessible entrance and make your way to the 6th floor. [SCREENSHOT:01:39]</li><li>On the 6th floor, look for barricaded doors. If another player has already been there, the doors may already be breached.</li><li>If the doors are barricaded, you will need to breach them to complete this objective. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_8_01-49.jpg\" alt=\"Breaching Barricaded Doors\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Spaceport Objective</h2><p>The final part of the quest is to scope out the rocket thrusters outside the Rocket Assembly building on the Spaceport map.</p><ul><li>Navigate to the Spaceport map. Locate the Rocket Assembly building on your map; it is a labeled location. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_9_02-11.jpg\" alt=\"Rocket Assembly Location\"></li><li>Once on the map, head towards the Rocket Assembly building.</li><li>Look for the large rocket thrusters lying on the side directly to the rear of the building. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_10_02-28.jpg\" alt=\"Rocket Thrusters Spotted\"></li><li>Simply approaching and standing near the thrusters will complete this objective.</li></ul><h2>Quest Completion</h2><p>Once all three objectives are completed, you can return to the main menu to claim your rewards for the 'Greasing Her Palms' quest.</p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_11_02-44.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Complete\"></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides step-by-step instructions to complete the 'Greasing Her Palms' quest in Arc Raiders across Dam Battlegrounds, Buried City, and Spaceport maps, including key locations and items needed.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/greasing-her-palms_0_00-07.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "On Dam Battlegrounds, visit the Locked Room in the Water Treatment Control Building.",
      "On Spaceport, scope out the rocket thrusters outside the Rocket Assembly",
      "On Buried City, visit the barricaded area on floor 6 of the Space Travel Building."
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
      {
        "id": "082c70c3-0fc7-40f1-8c08-73a65e239c40",
