  {
    "id": "fac2f005-7a78-4453-9fd0-9d0508782e5d",
    "title": "Handover",
    "slug": "handover",
    "content": "<h2>Overview: Handover  Quest</h2><p>This quest requires you to visit the Pattern House in the Dam area and mark it. You do not need to enter the building; the interaction point is on the exterior.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Pattern House</h2><ul><li>Open your map to find the Pattern House. It is situated on the northern side of The Dam map.</li><li>The Pattern House appears as a large, blocky apartment-like building on the map.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/handover_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Locate Pattern House on Map\"></p><h2>Step 2: Approach the Building's Exterior</h2><ul><li>Head towards the Pattern House as indicated on your map.</li><li>Once you are near, you will see the 'Victory Ridge Pattern House' objective marker appear on your screen.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/handover_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Arrive at Pattern House\"></p><h2>Step 3: Find and Mark the Pattern</h2><ul><li>Walk around the exterior of the Pattern House building.</li><li>Look for a small yellow circle interaction point on one of the walls.</li><li>Interact with the 'Spray Wall' prompt when it appears to mark the pattern and complete the quest.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/handover_2_00-19.jpg\" alt=\"Interact with Spray Wall\"></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides a quick and easy walkthrough for completing 'Handover' quest in Arc Raiders, which involves locating and marking the Pattern House.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/handover_0_00-05.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In one round: Visit the Pattern House in the Dam",
      "Mark the Pattern Outpost"
    ],
    "xp": 17000,
    "rewards": [
      {
        "id": "8e9064ba-de59-4e7d-b21f-e717004c2351",
        "item": {
          "id": "jolt-mine",
          "icon": "https://cdn.metaforge.app/arc-raiders/icons/jolt-mine.webp",
          "name": "Jolt Mine",
          "rarity": "Rare",
          "item_type": "Quick Use"
        },
        "item_id": "jolt-mine",
        "quantity": "2"
      }
    ],
    "video_url": null,
    "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:48:13.921073+00:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "acd1265e-bd36-4c11-b5a1-3cbd78c95244",
    "title": "Hatch Repairs",
    "slug": "hatch-repairs",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'Hatch Repairs' quest requires you to repair leaking hydraulic pipes near a Raider Hatch and then open it to retrieve a Raider Hatch Key. This guide will show you how to quickly complete this objective.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate a Raider Hatch</h2><p>Raider Hatches are crucial for this quest. You can find them scattered across different maps. For example, on the Dam Battlegrounds map, several Raider Hatches are available:</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/hatch-repairs_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Raider Hatch Map Locations\"></p><ul><li>Open your map to identify the locations of Raider Hatches. They are marked with specific icons.</li><li>Walk to any of these marked locations to begin the repair process.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Repair the Hatch</h2><p>Once you are near a Raider Hatch, you will need to repair the leaking hydraulic pipes. Look for a yellow prompt on the side of the hatch.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/hatch-repairs_1_00-17.jpg\" alt=\"Initiate Hatch Repair\"></p><ul><li>Approach the hatch and look for the 'REPAIR' prompt (usually on the side).</li><li>Hold down the interaction button (e.g., 'E' on PC) to begin the repair. A progress bar will appear.</li><li>Keep holding until the repair is complete.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Open the Hatch and Collect Key</h2><p>After successfully repairing the hatch, a new prompt will appear, allowing you to open it and collect your reward.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/hatch-repairs_2_00-24.jpg\" alt=\"Open Hatch and Trigger Key\"></p><ul><li>Immediately after repairing, a new 'OPEN' prompt will become available at the hatch.</li><li>Interact with this prompt to open the hatch.</li><li>Once opened, you will automatically pick up a 'Raider Hatch Key'. This key is essential for unlocking other Raider Hatches on the map.</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/hatch-repairs_3_00-31.jpg\" alt=\"Raider Hatch Key in Inventory\"></p><ul><li>You can confirm the key is in your inventory by opening your loadout screen.</li><li>The Raider Hatch Key is a key item that unlocks other Raider Hatches, which allows you to exfil instantly.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide provides a step-by-step walkthrough for completing the 'Hatch Repairs' quest in Arc Raiders, including how to locate Raider Hatches, repair them, and obtain a Raider Hatch Key.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/hatch-repairs_1_00-17.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Repair the leaking hydraulic pipes near a Raider Hatch",
      "Loot an ARC husk"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
    "rewards": [
