    "content": "<h2>Objectives</h2><ul><li>Deploy into Stella Montis</li><li>Find and search 3 Androids</li></ul><p><br></p><p>This one is actually very straightforward, you just load into the map and look around for cyborg bodies to loot. Locations are all over the place</p><p><br></p>",
