  {
    "id": "a637ca4d-d295-4fe7-b969-6d8200cd0be7",
    "title": "Industrial Espionage",
    "slug": "industrial-espionage",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'Industrial Espionage' quest requires you to find a weapon cache near the Gas Station in Buried City and plant a bug on it. This guide will help you quickly locate the objective and complete the task efficiently.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Quest Area on the Map</h2><p>The quest objective for 'Industrial Espionage' is located at the Gas Station in the far northern part of Buried City.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/industrial-espionage_0_00-05.jpg\" alt=\"Map Location of Gas Station\"></p><ul><li>Identify the 'Gas Station' waypoint in the far north of Buried City.</li><li>Set a waypoint to the Gas Station to mark your path.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Find the Weapon Cache</h2><p>Head towards the Gas Station. As you approach, you'll see a derelict, overturned vehicle or large metal container near the gas station sign. This is the weapon cache you need to interact with.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/industrial-espionage_1_00-12.jpg\" alt=\"Approaching the Weapon Cache\"></p><h2>Step 3: Drop Your Barrietta (Optional but Recommended)</h2><p>If you are currently carrying a Barrietta, it's highly recommended to drop it before interacting with the weapon cache to avoid losing it. You can pick it up again after completing the quest objective.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/industrial-espionage_3_00-20.jpg\" alt=\"Dropping the Barrietta\"></p><ul><li>If you have a Barrietta in your inventory, open your inventory and drop it on the ground.</li><li>This ensures you don't lose your weapon when interacting with the cache.</li></ul><h2>Step 4: Plant the Bug</h2><p>Once you are at the weapon cache, you will see an 'Interact' prompt. Activate this prompt to plant the bug and complete the quest step.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/industrial-espionage_4_00-28.jpg\" alt=\"Planting the Bug\"></p><ul><li>Approach the weapon cache until the 'Interact' prompt appears.</li><li>Press the interact key (e.g., 'E') to plant the bug.</li><li>A notification will confirm that the bug has been successfully planted.</li></ul>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/industrial-espionage_0_00-05.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Find Tian Wen's weapon cache near the Gas Station in the Outskirts",
      "Deliver the Burletta to the rival weapon cache",
      "Plant a bug on the weapon cache"
    ],
