  {
    "id": "1cc23af0-64b6-463f-879d-070c6e030d7f",
    "title": "Keeping the Memory",
    "slug": "keeping-the-memory",
    "content": "<p>This guide will walk you through completing the \"Keeping the Memory\" quest in Arc Raiders. You'll learn where to find the quest area, locate the missing helmet, and place it at the memorial.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Quest Area</h2><ul><li>Open your map and navigate to the \"Dam Battlegrounds\" area.</li><li>Zoom in and look for the specific location marked as \"Rackedge\". This is where you'll begin your search for the missing helmet. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/keeping-the-memory_0_00-09.jpg\" alt=\"Rackedge Map Location\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Find the Missing Helmet</h2><ul><li>Once you've arrived at the \"Wreckage\" area, look for a dense bush near a pile of black cables and fallen debris. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/keeping-the-memory_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Locate the Missing Helmet\"></li><li>Interact with the bush to search for the helmet. It should pop out once found.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Return the Helmet to the Memorial</h2><ul><li>After picking up the helmet, locate the nearby memorial stand, which is surrounded by more black cables. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/keeping-the-memory_2_00-24.jpg\" alt=\"Place the Helmet at Memorial\"></li><li>Interact with the stand to place the helmet and complete the \"Keeping the Memory\" quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "This guide will walk you through the 'Keeping the Memory' quest in Arc Raiders, detailing how to find the missing helmet and return it to the memorial.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/keeping-the-memory_2_00-24.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In One Round:",
      "Reach the wreckage in the Formicai Hills",
      "Search for the missing helmet",
      "Return the helmet to the memorial"
    ],
