  {
    "id": "fe259423-45b6-49e7-87c3-e7f175e0ff78",
    "title": "Lance's Tea Party",
    "slug": "lances-tea-party",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>This guide will help you locate the 2 Rubber Ducks and 2 Faded Photographs required for Lance's quests, such as 'The Bandage Run' and 'Lance's Tea Party'. These items are primarily found by looting residential areas.</p><h2>Step 1: General Item Information</h2><ul><li>Faded Photographs are relatively common and easier to find.</li><li>Rubber Ducks are much rarer, making them more challenging to acquire.</li><li>Both item types can generally be found by looting residential areas on any map.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Finding Faded Photographs</h2><p>While Faded Photographs can appear in any residential area, here are some recommended spots on the Dam map:</p><ul><li>Consider searching the <strong>Pale Apartments</strong> and <strong>Ruby Residence</strong> areas. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/lances-tea-party_0_00-11.jpg\" alt=\"Faded Photographs Suggested Locations (Dam)\"></li><li>Another good location is the <strong>Pattern House</strong>, situated in the northern part of the map. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/lances-tea-party_1_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Pattern House Location (Dam)\"></li><li>Actively loot all drawers and containers you encounter in these areas to maximize your chances. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/lances-tea-party_2_00-20.jpg\" alt=\"Looting for Faded Photographs\"></li><li>Faded Photographs will appear in your inventory once collected. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/lances-tea-party_3_00-21.jpg\" alt=\"Faded Photograph Collected in Inventory\"></li></ul><h2>Step 3: Finding Rubber Ducks</h2><p>Rubber Ducks are rarer, but specific residential zones can yield better results. On the Buried City map, focus your search here:</p><ul><li>Head to the <strong>Santa Maria Houses</strong> located in Old Town. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/lances-tea-party_4_00-30.jpg\" alt=\"Rubber Duck Suggested Locations (Buried City)\"></li><li>Thoroughly loot all drawers and shelves within these houses. The spawn is random, so persistence is key. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/lances-tea-party_5_00-37.jpg\" alt=\"Looting for Rubber Ducks\"></li><li>Once found, the Rubber Duck will be added to your inventory. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/lances-tea-party_6_00-38.jpg\" alt=\"Rubber Duck Collected in Inventory\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "A quick guide to finding Rubber Ducks and Faded Photographs for Lance's quest in Arc Raiders, including suggested looting locations and tips.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/lances-tea-party_1_00-15.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Get 2 Rubber Ducks for Lance",
      "Get 2 Faded Photographs for Lance"
    ],
    "xp": 18000,
    "rewards": [
      {
        "id": "74d7f9c3-dd49-4da3-af2e-2077c7b43205",
        "item": {
          "id": "defibrillator",
          "icon": "https://cdn.metaforge.app/arc-raiders/icons/defibrillator.webp",
          "name": "Defibrillator",
          "rarity": "Rare",
