  {
    "id": "10ed4b7e-92b5-45bb-8f2e-9fdc99f71405",
    "title": "Life of a Pharmacist",
    "slug": "life-of-a-pharmacist",
    "content": "<h2>Overview: Life of a Pharmacist Quest</h2><p>The 'Life of a Pharmacist' quest requires you to document several items within a specific pharmacy building in Buried City. This guide will walk you through the precise locations of each item to complete the quest efficiently.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Pharmacy</h2><ul><li>Open your map and navigate to Buried City.</li><li>The quest target, a pharmacy building labeled 'Farmacia', is located near Piazza Arbusto. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/life-of-a-pharmacist_0_00-10.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Map Location\"></li><li>Head towards the building with the large 'Farmacia' sign. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/life-of-a-pharmacist_1_00-12.jpg\" alt=\"Pharmacy Exterior\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Enter and Navigate the Pharmacy</h2><ul><li>Enter the pharmacy through the door located to the left of the main entrance sign. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/life-of-a-pharmacist_2_00-15.jpg\" alt=\"Entering Pharmacy\"></li><li>Once inside, proceed past the main counter area and through the door straight ahead.</li><li>Go up the staircase immediately after entering the second room.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Document the Pharmacist's Family</h2><ul><li>At the top of the stairs, directly in front of you, you'll find a picture hanging on the wall.</li><li>Interact with the picture to document the pharmacist's family. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/life-of-a-pharmacist_3_00-23.jpg\" alt=\"Documenting Family Picture\"></li></ul><h2>Step 4: Document the Pharmacist's Skills</h2><ul><li>From the picture, turn right and enter the adjacent room.</li><li>Locate the piano in this room.</li><li>Interact with the piano to document the pharmacist's skills. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/life-of-a-pharmacist_4_00-30.jpg\" alt=\"Documenting Piano (Skills)\"></li></ul><h2>Step 5: Document the Pharmacist's Hobbies</h2><ul><li>From the piano, turn around and enter the next room through the doorway.</li><li>On the wall, you will see a shelf with potted plants.</li><li>Interact with these plants to document the pharmacist's hobbies. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/life-of-a-pharmacist_5_00-36.jpg\" alt=\"Documenting Potted Plants (Hobbies)\"></li></ul><h2>Step 6: Document the Pharmacist's Taste</h2><ul><li>From the plants, turn around and head back towards the staircase.</li><li>Look for a table positioned underneath the stairs.</li><li>Interact with this table to document the pharmacist's taste. <img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/life-of-a-pharmacist_6_00-43.jpg\" alt=\"Documenting Table (Taste)\"></li><li>After documenting all four items, your 'Life of a Pharmacist' quest should be complete.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/life-of-a-pharmacist_1_00-12.jpg",
    "author": "All4nDev",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Find the Arbuso Farmacia then search the apartment above",
      "Document the pharmacist's hobbies",
      "Document the pharmacist's family",
      "Document the pharmacist's taste",
      "Document the pharmacist's skills"
    ],
