  {
    "id": "e9b42884-76a2-4d97-947c-92c44b6fb66b",
    "title": "Marked for Death",
    "slug": "marked-for-death",
    "content": "<p>This guide will walk you through completing the \"Marked for Death\" quest in ARC Raiders, helping you find the drop-off point and follow the clues to finish the mission.</p><h2>Step 1: Locate the Drop-off Point</h2><p><br></p><ul><li>Start by opening your quests menu and selecting the \"Marked for Death\" quest.</li><li>Navigate to the Su Durante Warehouses, located on the far northwest side of the Buried City map.</li><li><br></li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/marked-for-death_1_00-27.jpg\" alt=\"Warehouse Location\"></li><li>Once you reach the warehouses, head to the back southwest side of the building.</li><li>Look for a small box near the wall.</li><li>Interact with the box to \"Investigate\" it. This completes the first part of the mission.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/marked-for-death_2_00-38.jpg\" alt=\"Investigate Drop-off\"></li></ul><h2>Step 2: Follow the Clues</h2><ul><li>After investigating the box, you'll need to follow the clues.</li><li>Look for a set of footsteps leading west from the box. Follow these footsteps through the fence and into a group of bushes.</li><li><br></li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/marked-for-death_3_00-48.jpg\" alt=\"Follow Footsteps\"></li><li>In the bushes, you'll find another item to \"Inspect\".</li><li><br></li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/marked-for-death_4_00-54.jpg\" alt=\"Inspect Final Clue\"></li><li>Interacting with this item will complete the quest.</li><li>All that's left is to exfil to finish the mission and collect your rewards.</li><li><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/marked-for-death_5_00-59.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Complete\"></li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/marked-for-death_5_00-59.jpg",
    "author": "Arc Raiders API",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "Reach the Su Durante Warehouses in the Outskirts in Buried City",
      "Search for Tian Wen's cache near the Warehouses",
      "Follow the Clues"
    ],
    "xp": 0,
