  {
    "id": "fd9dc8d4-298c-4786-a652-afdb302fbd7a",
    "title": "Market Correction",
    "slug": "market-correction",
    "content": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>The 'Market Correction' quest in ARC Raiders requires you to locate and sabotage a cache near Marano Station in the Buried City map. This guide will walk you through the steps to complete this objective.</p><h2>Step 1: Navigate to Marano Station</h2><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/market-correction-quest_1_00-27.jpg\" alt=\"Marano Station Map Location\"></p><ul><li>Open your in-game map and locate 'Buried City'.</li><li>Find 'Marano Station' on the map, which is typically found in the outskirts area.</li><li>Set a waypoint to Marano Station to guide your approach. It's recommended to spawn on the northwest side of the map to save time.</li></ul><h2>Step 2: Locate the Cache (Sabotage Point)</h2><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/market-correction-quest_2_00-41.jpg\" alt=\"Approaching the Cache\"></p><ul><li>Upon reaching Marano Station, head to the back of the station building.</li><li>You will find two rummage bins located next to the wall. This is where the cache is hidden.</li></ul><h2>Step 3: Sabotage the Cache</h2><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/market-correction-quest_3_00-44.jpg\" alt=\"Sabotage Action\"></p><ul><li>Interact with the rummage bins (press 'Investigate').</li><li>After investigating, you will be given the option to 'Sabotage' the cache. Confirm this action.</li></ul><h2>Step 4: Escape the Area</h2><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/market-correction-quest_4_00-47.jpg\" alt=\"Quest Completion Update\"></p><ul><li>Once the cache is sabotaged, your quest objective will update, indicating successful sabotage.</li><li>All that's left is to extract the area to fully complete the quest.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
    "summary": "XP: 0",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://iiugcpaznnwcegwificd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guides/screenshots/market-correction-quest_0_00-04.jpg",
    "author": "Arc Raiders API",
    "type": "quest",
    "objectives": [
      "In One Round -",
      "Locate the cache near Marano Station.",
      "Sabotage the cache"
    ],
